HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ppff packet filtering mechanism first appeared in OpenBSD 3.0 and then
     FreeBSD 5.2.

     This implementation is derived from OpenBSD 4.5.  A number of individual
     features, improvements, bug fixes and security fixes have been ported
     from later versions of OpenBSD.  It has been heavily modified to be capa‐
     ble of running in multithreaded FreeBSD kernel and scale its performance
     on multiple CPUs.

